.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5570945/)\nciteturn43search6 [wordlim: 200] Published: 9.2 years ago; Crawled: last month; 81 (body group 2)  | LjCLE30  | Lj2g3v1277900.1  | 109  | chr2:20511088..20511417  | forward  | No  | 23 ... MtCLE17 shares a similar expression pattern to PvCLE23, GmCLE23a and GmCLE23b ^{[ref-type: bibr] 3 [Source reference: [Source link 126]]}, being expressed across all tissue types except in seeds, with MtCLE17 also having notable higher expression in flowers than that of its putative orthologues, which shows little expression in the flower tissue (Table [ref-type: table] 2 [Source reference: [Source link 127]]). ... Recent advances in genome sequencing, bioinformatics resources and the identification of entire CLE peptide families of soybean, common bean and Arabidopsis, have been utilised to capture the entire CLE peptide-encoding gene families of two important model legume species, M. truncatula and L. japonicus. ... This work was funded by the Hermon Slade Foundation, and Australian Research Council Discovery Project grants (DP130103084 and DP130102266).\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHandelsregisterauszug von Meenen Holding GmbH & Co. KG aus Lilienthal (HRA 200958) (https://www.online-handelsregister.de/handelsregisterauszug/ni/Walsrode/HRA/200958/Meenen-Holding-GmbH-Co-KG)\nciteturn43search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; C-20511417\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData Pendidikan Kemendikdasmen (https://referensi.data.kemendikdasmen.go.id/pendidikan/dikdas/051205/3/jf/5/s1)\nciteturn43search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; 17  | 20511417  | SD NEGERI 2 KARANGANYAR  | Rt.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSwiss Military Hanowa Sonoran Chrono (Chronograph, 43 mm) - Galaxus (https://www.galaxus.be/en/s8/product/swiss-military-hanowa-sonoran-chrono-chronograph-43-mm-wristwatche